<p class="eyebrow">LIGHTING CONDITIONS</p>
<h2 class="h2 recede-h" id="themes-h">Three ways to read in the dark.</h2>
<p class="narr recede"><strong>Microfilm</strong>: a backlit reader in a quiet records room. <strong>Black Lodge</strong>: blue-black night, curtain red, dreamy teal. <strong>Cold Case</strong>: sepia, like aged folder stock. Choose your lighting. The reading stays perfect in all three.</p>
