<p class="tcard__title">Inventory of the Quiet Floor</p>
<p class="tcard__text">The inventory was taken at night, when the building was quiet enough to count. Each drawer was opened, its contents named aloud, and closed again. The clerk wrote in pencil, in case anything needed to be revised.</p>
